0599222", "w": 2236}], "new-town-sarbojanin": [{"at": "2026-10-12T16:04:26.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1988905391904931840/oFFI4KW3_normal.jpg", "evidence": true, "h": 2296, "handle": "abasu4ever", "id": "2109676575524598226", "media": [{"h": 2296, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUcTS1AawAAB41L.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 4020}, {"h": 3830, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUcTaFobcAAWhsH.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 2220}, {"h": 2180, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUcTnfPagAAHlfz.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 3992}, {"h": 3844, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUcTpZ_aAAAhw0A.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 2126}], "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUcTS1AawAAB41L.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 99, "text": "📍 New Town Sarbojanin. 🎨 Rintu Das, RSS &amp; BJP. 🌟 The theme celebrates the significance of 'lotus' in Hinduism. 👉 With the regime change, New Town Sarbojanin are doing traditional Durga Puja for the first time. I really loved the pandal, but not the idol. 📌 #DurgaPuja2026", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109676575524598226", "w": 4020}], "rajdanga-naba-uday-sangha": [{"at": "2026-10-11T18:26:21.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2015850929397104642/ZhuSn-qV_normal.jpg", "evidence": true, "h": 3230, "handle": "SudhanidhiB", "id": "2109349903600374159", "media": [{"h": 3230, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUXqikGbQAA--tN.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 2722}, {"h": 4000, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUXqjUYacAAS8Dv.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 3000}], "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUXqikGbQAA--tN.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 99, "text": "#2 Visited Didi @keyakahe's Durga Puja at Rajdanga Naba Uday Sangha. Unreal colour combination as theme.", "url": "https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2109349903600374159", "w": 2722}], "samaj-sebi-sangha": [