540673/img/_Ew0c9S9a6ds_Ctw.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 99, "text": "#WATCH | Kolkata, West Bengal: CM Suvendu Adhikari inaugurates the 91st Santosh Mitra Square Durga Puja in Bowbazar. Celebrating its 91st year, the pandal's grand theme for 2026 is 'Vande Mataram', marking the 150th anniversary of the national song. (11.10)", "url": "https://x.com/ANI/status/2109450971617349957", "w": 1024}, {"at": "2026-10-12T08:46:48.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1988905391904931840/oFFI4KW3_normal.jpg", "evidence": true, "h": 2302, "handle": "abasu4ever", "id": "2109566442769461704", "media": [{"h": 2302, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUavbsxbEAAPBVq.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 3704}, {"h": 4096, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUavdmsawAAumwH.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 2298}, {"h": 1800, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUavetIbYAAI-x8.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 3844}, {"h": 2244, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUavfcJaAAAuslD.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 3990}], "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUavbsxbEAAPBVq.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 99, "text": "📍 Santosh Mitra Square. 🎨 Shib Shankar Das, Narendra Modi, Amit Shah &amp; Sajal Ghosh. 🌟 The theme is Vande Mataram. 👉 The pandal looks good, but it can't beat the 2022 one. 📌 #DurgaPuja2026 🧵 1/3", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109566442769461704", "w": 3704}, {"at": "2026-10-13T13:09:49.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2106419992061423616/jCPCpUM-_normal.jpg", "h": 2252, "handle": "UmaimaSaeed", "id": "2109995021416165598", "media": [{"h": 2252, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUg1P_5bIAAdGgT.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 2034}, {"h": 2138, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUg1QnqaYAA9wCZ.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 3799}, {"h": 4000, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUg1RZtbkAAHIwI.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 2252}, {"h": 2252, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUg1SEMaMAAHqJ7.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 4000}], "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUg1P_5bIAAdGgT.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 10.3, "text": "Visited Santosh Mitra square today. Would have looked 10x prettier after dusk, but I skipped the light and sound show to avoid the insane crowd. Theme is around the 1947 partition, freedom fighters, Vande Mataram etc. Original photos from the partition era have been displayed.", "url": "https://x.com/UmaimaSaeed/status/2109995021416165598", "w": 2034}, {"at": "2026-10-12T17:48:09.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2089301437339856896/PP94Zlu7_normal.jpg", "h": 4080, "handle": "a_random_2020_", "id": "2109702677395624153", "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUcrGACbUAAo2_I.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 9.3, "text": "Went to Santosh Mitra Square today and it did give me goosebumps, an opportunity to pay tributes to our greatest freedom fighters and also reflect on the horrors of Partition", "url": "https://x.com/a_random_2020_/status/2109702677395624153", "w": 3060}], "santoshpur-lake-pally": [{"at": "2026-10-12T18:45:22.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2057169133540982784/hGLltAfY_normal.jpg", "evidence": true, "handle": "SuvenduWB", "id": "2109717078550978709", "score": 99, "text": "Inaugurated: Lake Pally Sarbojanin, Santoshpur · 1 of 9 pujas in the CM’s video post (translated)", "url": "https://x.com/SuvenduWB/status/2109717078550978709"}], "shib-mandir": [{"at": "2026-10-14T07:14:48.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1988905391904931840/oFFI4KW3_normal.jpg", "h": 2226, "handle": "abasu4ever", "id": "2110268065644728589", "media": [{"h": 2226, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUktkmpbYAAIbyP.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 3898}, {"h": 3506, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUktlidboAAikQO.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 2212}, {"h": 2270, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUktmUubcAAgVyn.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 3966}, {"h": 2270, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUktnTebMAAvbKP.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 4036}], "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUktkmpbYAAIbyP.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 7.48, "text": "📍 Shibmandir Sarbojanin @ 90. 🎨 Prasanta Pal. 🌟 The theme celebrates 'Gangaur', a form of Durga Puja that is done in Rajasthan during the season of spring. 👉 Arguably one of the best Durga Pujas this year!!! 📌 #DurgaPuja2026", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2110268065644728589", "w": 3898}], "singhi-park": [{"at": "2026-10-13T18:16:43.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2109322034627125248/y0lsWL_9_normal.jpg", "evidence": true, "h": 3060, "handle": "_Epinephrine_", "id": "2110072254080127323", "media": [{"h": 3060, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUh7fLBa8AA-Z_N.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 4080}, {"h": 3060, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUh7gREaIAAwqRm.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 4080}, {"h": 3060, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUh7hQ6akAAxRMC.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 4080}], "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUh7fLBa8AA-Z_N.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 99, "text": "📍Singhi Park She is so Divine🥹🥹🥹💕💕💕💕💕", "url": "https://x.com/_Epinephrine_/status/2110072254080127323", "w": 4080}], "sovabazar-rajbari": [{"at": "2026-10-13T18:52:49.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2058706046768857088/bV6iP4gT_normal.jpg", "h": 981, "handle": "sol_supremus", "id": "2110081339374592071", "media": [{"h": 981, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUiDxEubwAA0Cmk.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 736}, {"h": 1345, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUiDxqabwAArHnV.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 1280}, {"h": 638, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUiDyS5bgAAQNsV.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 480}, {"h": 452, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUiDysmaYAAe_Yg.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 678}], "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUiDxEubwAA0Cmk.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 11.38, "text": "The origin of the Kumortuli Durga Thakur (idols) dates back to 1757, following the historic Battle of Plassey. When Raja Nabakrishna Deb of the Shobhabazar Rajbari wanted to host a grand Durga Puja to celebrate the victory over Islamic tyranny of Siraj-ud-Daulah, he brought…", "url": "https://x.com/sol_supremus/status/2110081339374592071", "w": 736}], "sree-bhumi-sporting-club": [{"at": "2026-10-12T06:25:07.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2067950378625400832/xu_GIM2J_normal.jpg", "evidence": true, "h": 1980, "handle": "cmowbgov", "id": "2109530787431465212", "media": [{"h": 1980, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUaOxc_bkAA6RGi.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 3520}, {"h": 1980, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUaOzLpbgAAJ-rD.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 3520}, {"h": 1267, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUaO2QebQAAWBSJ.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 1600}, {"h": 1064, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUaO4k9a4AA9iZV.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 1600}], "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUaOxc_bkAA6RGi.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 99, "text": "The Hon’ble Chief Minister of West Bengal, Shri Suvendu Adhikari, inaugurated the Durga Pujas of Santosh Mitra Square and Sree Bhumi Sporting Club in Kolkata. He joined the celebrations of Bengal’s rich cultural heritage and traditions, marking the occasion with joy and cultural", "url": "https://x.com/cmowbgov/status/2109530787431465212", "w": 3520}, {"at": "2026-10-13T11:36:18.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1910696171145768960/T3K0YnlK_normal.jpg", "h": 3264, "handle": "an1sh123", "id": "2109971486106886421", "media": [{"h": 3264, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUgf2sIbcAAg9sP.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 2448}, {"h": 2448, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUgf38QbMAEAbBg.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 3264}], "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUgf2sIbcAAg9sP.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 10.0, "text": "#1 Visited Sreebhumi for the first and last time. Pandal is closed lmao. They haven't even finished the pandal but still inaugurated it last night. Nothing spectacular. No point in travelling that much to see it.", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2109971486106886421", "w": 2448}, {"at": "2026-10-13T13:51:33.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2105641119375822848/GeVwpPR8_normal.jpg", "h": 960, "handle": "DycKarimganj", "id": "2110005524192497677", "media": [{"h": 960, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUg-v2-aAAA5kuJ.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 1280}, {"h": 719, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUg-wrja8AEUkU0.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 1280}, {"h": 960, "src": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUg-xfUbEAAn-sM.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "video": false, "w": 1280}], "photo": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUg-v2-aAAA5kuJ.jpg?format=jpg&name=large", "score": 10.0, "text": "Mybharat Sribhumi organised international day for disaster risk reduction today in Badarpur.", "url": "https://x.com/DycKarimganj/status/2110005524192497677", "w": 1280}, {"at": "2026-10-11T13:30:01.000Z", "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1998588969983016960/Y852kCAZ_normal.jpg", "handle": "HeyyyyShubham", "id": "2109275327331537045", "score": 6.85, "text": "I'm already missing the days when I was in Kolkata during Navratri and Durga Puja! When I was studying for CA Foundation, I had coaching friends, and we went to Sreebhumi Sporting Club together. Another year, I went with a female friend I met during my IT training.", "url": "https: